 Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"f4vbnGoGo3eWorVekctVGQ","review_id":"o3JCqrlW29cEdCTarjjYaA","date":"2010-11-26T20:30:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9461042881011963,"text_excerpt":"I went for Sunday brunch, and i thought it was a nice casual breakfast spot. Their grits are amazing, I am not a grits fan, but I had read so many rave reviews that I had to try, and they did not let me down. I got the Huevos Rancheros, which were fine, but my friend got the B.E.S.T. sandwich (Bacon Egg Spinach(?) Tomato) and it looked amazing, so that is what I am going to try on my next visit. Coffee was good as well. Cool atmosphere, not too many tables, but we did not have to wait for one."},{"business_id":"f4vbnGoGo3eWorVekctVGQ","review_id":"KKBMrnCzGLb_d8BoLT4cZA","date":"2012-02-09T16:57:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9393894672393799,"text_excerpt":"Long wait, but it was packed in there (Thursday morning around 9:30 AM). All the staff members are SUPER nice. They def have the best bowl of grits in the whole damn city. I got the Garden omelette, which has spinach, onion, and tomatoes, and I substituted egg whites for an extra $1. So for $7.95 I got an egg white omelette, toast, and a huge bowl of grits. Add a $2.50 cup of single americano and you have a reasonably priced, delicious, healthy breakfast :-) My friend got some sort of pesto goat cheese avocado croissant concoction which looked divine...Refuel wins"},{"business_id":"f4vbnGoGo3eWorVekctVGQ","review_id":"qYs7bYUILRrb4A7ym9dPTA","date":"2016-06-04T02:27:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9337809681892395,"text_excerpt":"Visited Refuel for the first time on Thursday for lunch and loved it. It's very close to Tulane and just a small drive from Palmer Park. My coworker had the Huevos Rancheros which were amazing and fresh. I had the Mushroom Omelet with classic grits and it was one of the best breakfasts I've ever had. Very generous portions as well! I also shared a banana/oj/berry smoothie which was also fresh. I was very impressed with how clean this location was in addition to the quality of their meals. Will definitely go back when in NOLA."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"f4vbnGoGo3eWorVekctVGQ","photo_id":"kAkrzk5NSZS1dlUiXcBUrQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/kAkrzk5NSZS1dlUiXcBUrQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9138808250427246},{"business_id":"f4vbnGoGo3eWorVekctVGQ","photo_id":"m05Oqnee0vIib_kG_dNd0w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/m05Oqnee0vIib_kG_dNd0w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9088336229324341},{"business_id":"f4vbnGoGo3eWorVekctVGQ","photo_id":"ZyXAM4FVImViDpO-Zjtv3w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ZyXAM4FVImViDpO-Zjtv3w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8909850716590881},{"business_id":"f4vbnGoGo3eWorVekctVGQ","photo_id":"Gndke6UZlhjZfAuY4UfbZw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Gndke6UZlhjZfAuY4UfbZw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8893564343452454},{"business_id":"f4vbnGoGo3eWorVekctVGQ","photo_id":"ZIxu4pRYtsEgsT-BdxklFg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ZIxu4pRYtsEgsT-BdxklFg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8377172350883484}]},"notebook_case":null}
